{"4770700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warfare Marionettes", "steam_appid": 4770700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Warfare Marionettes</strong>, players take control of a skilled Cyberhunter sent on a critical mission to infiltrate TSAR Genomics, a massive government-funded weapons facility moments away from destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally tasked with creating advanced military technology, TSAR Genomics refused to weaponize a dangerous experimental formula that could be dispersed in a devastating cloudburst attack. Behind the scenes, however, the government secretly collaborated with a rogue technician named Marcus to complete the project in secret before issuing orders to eliminate the entire facility and silence everyone involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As chaos erupts across the base, players must battle through hostile soldiers, mutated aliens, and deadly security forces while uncovering hidden truths behind the conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fast-paced third-person combat, cover shooting, vehicular warfare, exploration, skill-based abilities, progression systems, and multiple game-play modes, Warfare Marionettes delivers an action-packed sci-fi experience centered around survival, secrecy, and betrayal.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Warfare Marionettes</strong>, players take control of a skilled Cyberhunter sent on a critical mission to infiltrate TSAR Genomics, a massive government-funded weapons facility moments away from destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally tasked with creating advanced military technology, TSAR Genomics refused to weaponize a dangerous experimental formula that could be dispersed in a devastati